      "claim": "The query is an Evans-blue-class bis-azo tetrasulfonated dye; the very close analog Pontamine sky blue (Molecule 11, Morgan similarity 0.74) showed progressive brain staining after systemic administration once the capillary endothelium was disrupted, directly supporting CNS access under the query's disrupted-barrier condition.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive",
