    {
      "claim": "The poor brain uptake reported for NXY-059 under ischemia involved a small disulfonated nitrone rather than a large albumin-binding bis-azo dye, so it has limited structural transferability to the query and does not overcome the disrupted-barrier leakage evidence.",
